Sorted, I had:
fit <- auto.arima(as.ts(rnorm(100))
fitDF <- as.data.frame(fit)
What I needed was:
fit <- auto.arima(as.ts(rnorm(100))
fitDF <- as.data.frame(forecast(fit, h=10))
Sorry for the silly question. -- H
