Hi Charles,

If you don't want facets, don't use them! Try this (untested):

a <- ggplot(aggdata, aes(x = month, y = case.dump.rvu,

                       fill = year, group = year))

b <- a + geom_bar(position="dodge")
print(b)

HTH,
Ista

