hi, you can change the shape of legend, e.g.:

ggplot(d[1:100, ])+ geom_point(aes(x,y,color=cats),shape='.') +
guides(colour = guide_legend(override.aes = list(shape = 1)))

2012年4月12日11:57 John Jumper <john.m...@gmail.com>:

> ibrary(ggplot2)
> nplot=40
> npoint = 25000
> ncat = 4
> cats = sample(1:ncat, npoint*nplot, replace=TRUE)
> d=data.frame(x=rnorm(npoint*nplot)+2*cats, y=rnorm(npoint*nplot),
> cats=factor(cats), plotnum=1:nplot)
> ggplot(d)+ geom_point(aes(x,y,color=cats),shape='.') +
> facet_wrap(~plotnum,ncol=8)

