Subject: Standardizing a legend for an animation
Message-ID: <fM9DPtGVVMI.io3c4wHQ68oJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/fM9DPtGVVMI/m/io3c4wHQ68oJ>
