Slight correction, the 'step' geom is warranted -

x <-1:10
qplot(x,ecdf(x)(x), geom = "line")

r <- extendrange(range(x))
s <- seq(r[1], r[2], length.out = 501)
qplot(s, ecdf(x)(s), geom = "step")
plot(ecdf(x))

Cheers
david.

