Subject: Re: Error when using facet_wrap on geom_histogram
Message-ID: <jGVzQi6Kmjk.GZdkY9NAtG4J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <jGVzQi6Kmjk.IwJROwE-va8J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <jGVzQi6Kmjk.Th-Dci8ZBu8J@ggplot2.groups.google.com> <jGVzQi6Kmjk.IwJROwE-va8J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
